symbol/VFS.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/VFS.png","website":"https://www.vinfastauto.us","ceo":"Vuong Nhat Pham","full_time_employees":"29878","description":"VinFast Auto Ltd. is an international company that specializes in the design, development, and production of electric vehicles (EVs), e-scooters, and e-buses. Its operations extend across Vietnam, Canada, and the United States. The company's core business is organized into three distinct segments: Cars, E-scooters, and E-buses. VinFast handles the entire lifecycle for its e-scooters, from initial design and development through manufacturing and sales. Additionally, it provides vital battery leasing and charging solutions to support its diverse range of electric cars, e-scooters, and e-buses. Its extensive product portfolio includes various electric models such as SUVs, mini-cars, mid-size pickup trucks, and 7-seater MPVs, alongside E-buses, E-scooters, and electric bikes. VinFast is also actively involved in developing advanced battery technology and related solutions. Headquartered in Hai Phong City, Vietnam, VinFast Auto Ltd. functions as a subsidiary of the larger Vingroup Joint Stock Company.","description_en":"VinFast Auto Ltd. is an international company that specializes in the design, development, and production of electric vehicles (EVs), e-scooters, and e-buses. Its operations extend across Vietnam, Canada, and the United States. The company's core business is organized into three distinct segments: Cars, E-scooters, and E-buses. VinFast handles the entire lifecycle for its e-scooters, from initial design and development through manufacturing and sales. Additionally, it provides vital battery leasing and charging solutions to support its diverse range of electric cars, e-scooters, and e-buses. Its extensive product portfolio includes various electric models such as SUVs, mini-cars, mid-size pickup trucks, and 7-seater MPVs, alongside E-buses, E-scooters, and electric bike